<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Uyohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur uwu inggbaashia Uyohana aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Uyohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Uyo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur uwu inggbaashia</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uyohana</para>
  <para style="mt2">aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur uwu inggbaashia Uyohana aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="ip">Awu Uyohana uner itser Uyesu atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ. Abɔɔ akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ra amɛk aki 85-95 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Uyohana atsɛng undzumu itsi arherhe avaa ru ubvur uwurɛ. Unga afituwe abika avarhu ubvur ha umbɔ asisei ri iwɛrhɛ nggu Unum nu Ungwɛ̃nga Uyesu Ukiristo, nu ikɛi igbiir ato umbɔ ri itsi abika amesuwe imesi igbɛrangwĩ iyiriyɛ iki idakuwe iwɛrhɛmbɔ nggu Unum. Imesa iyɛrɛ ha imesuwe ugɛ abinkɛ aka awe ru upfung anera aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ abanga, awu abin arhim, ikɛi igɛ Uyesu, Ungwɛ̃ Unum asi iwea unera. Abika amesuwe imesa ha agɛ ififɔrh iwu ri itsũwe amɛn ru ibibɛk ru upfung ukpirɛ, ikɛi imesuwe igɛ ififɔrh isi iwengge iyi amɛn aka aze use ibema adɔka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɔr uner uwuku utsɛng ubvur uwurɛ amesuwe ugɛ Uyesu awu unera, ikɛi agɛ ubɛn unerwi aka awe ru imangmang ru Uyesu na abemunga Unum awu ufang umbɔ abema adɔka ikɛi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Irhirhang nggu uzĩ <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 1:5-2:29">1.5—2.29</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Awɛkaci Unum nggu awɛkaci Undenggũ <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 3:1-24">3.1-24</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Idzidzɛrhe nggu igbɛrangwĩ <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 4:1-6">4.1-6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ibibema adɔka <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 4:7-21">4.7-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ikpũ imangmang <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 5:1-21">5.1-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Urhɛm urhɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1"/>Umɛn ĩdũwũwa umbi Urhɛm ukpuku udzowe urhɛ, uwu ha aka awe ri inggbaashia, uwu ha umɛn iki igũ, uwu ha umɛn iki inyã ra asumɛn, uwu ha umɛn iki inyã ni ibanga nggu abokmɛn. <verse eid="1JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2"/>Urhɛ ha udzeka. Umɛn inyãmɛn umgbɔ ni idzowe ideka umgbɔ. Umɛn ĩdũwũwa umbi urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa, uku uwe nggu Utɛ nu udzeka ru umɛn. <verse eid="1JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3"/>Umɛn ĩdũwũwa umbi ubinkpi umɛn iki inyã ni igũ, ngge ima itsu umbi awe ri ikikɔng iwɛrhɛ nggu umɛn. Iwɛrhamɛn iwu nggu Utɛ nu Ungwɛ̃nga Uyesu Ukiristo. <verse eid="1JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4"/>Umɛn itsɛng akɛrɛ ngge itsú anggɔmmɛn atsuafɛr.<verse eid="1JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uzɛ̃rhã ri irhirhang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5"/>Isarhe ha iyɛ umɛn iki igũ ru unga ni ĩdũwũwa umbi, Unum awu irhirhang. Ru unga uzĩ ushikpɔ uko ukunjiir. <verse eid="1JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6"/>Umɛn ĩba ĩgɔr ugɛ umɛn iwemɛn ri iwɛrhɛ nggu unga bɔr ni izɛ̃rhã ru uzĩ, umɛn igbɛrangwĩ ni isi ikorhumɛn idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="1JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7"/>Bɔr umɛn ĩba izɛ̃rhã ri irhirhang, ru nyaka unga aka awe ri irhirhang, umɛn iwemɛn ri iwɛrhɛ nggu adɔka, nu adzirh Uyesu, Ungwɛ̃nga, asorh umɛn ra arhimmɛn kishoo.<verse eid="1JN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8"/>Umɛn ĩba ĩgɔr ugɛ umɛn ishimɛn ra arhim, umɛn irhɛm atsimɛn nu idzidzɛrhe ishingge ru umɛn. <verse eid="1JN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9"/>Bɔr umɛn ĩba isɔmmɛn arhimmɛn, Unum awu uner idzidzɛrhe na arhika, awuri itsũwũka arhimmɛn na asorhuwa umɛn ri kishoo ida irhirhikamɛn. <verse eid="1JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10"/>Umɛn ĩba igɔr ugɛ umɛn isi ikorhumɛn arhim, umɛn itsu unga awu uner igbɛrangwĩ nu arherhanga ashike ra amɛnmɛn.<verse eid="1JN 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1"/>A aze angwɛ̃mum, umum itsɛnga umbi akɛrɛ utsur umbi agbambi ra arhim. Bɔr unera aba agba ra arhim, umɛn iwemɛn ru uwuku urherha arherhe nggu Utɛ, uwuku ukaa umɛn, Uyesu Ukiristo uwuku urhurhika ha. <verse eid="1JN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2"/>Unga awu idɛm-Num iyiki itsũwe arhimmɛn, asi iwea akimɛn ukpekũ nu aki anera kishoo ru upfunga ikɛi.<verse eid="1JN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3"/>Umɛn ĩba ĩdɔsumɛn ikpem Unum, mɔcɛ umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ umɛn ihwɛngmɛn unga. <verse eid="1JN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4"/>Unera aba agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ihwɛng unga,&gt;&gt; bɔr asi ikorhunga ubinkpi ikpemnga iki irherhe, unga agbɛrangwĩ, nu idzidzɛrhe ishingge ru unga. <verse eid="1JN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5"/>Bɔr unera aba adɔsunga urhɛm Unum, idzidzɛrhe ibibemu Unum ighwɛrngge ikpũrhã ru unga. Akɛrɛ atsu umɛn ihwɛng ugɛ umɛn iwemɛn ru unga. <verse eid="1JN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6"/>Ubɛn unera aka agɔr agɛ unga abɛk ru unga, awu ufang unga azɛ̃rhã ru nyaka Uyesu aka akorhe.<verse eid="1JN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7"/>A aze awɛrhamum, umum isi itsɛngamum umbi ikpem iyiki ifa bɔr iyiki igbe, iyi ha umbi aka ayɛi ri inggbaashia. Ikpem iki igbe ha iwu isarhayɛ umbi aka agũ ri nyaku iki ifa ha. <verse eid="1JN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8"/>Ikpem hã ikɛi iwu iyiki ifa. Idzidzɛrhangge anyã ngge ru unga nu umbi, ubinkutsu uzĩ uni ititɔng nu irhirhang idzidzɛrhe iki ini irhang.<verse eid="1JN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9"/>Ubɛn unera aka agɔr agɛ unga awe ru irhirhang hã bɔr unga akpɛ̃ɛ̃ ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ, ana awe ru uzĩ. <verse eid="1JN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10"/>Uwuruwi aka abemu ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ awu ri irhirhang hã, nu utarh ukpuku ukwɛr itok ushikpɔ ru unga. <verse eid="1JN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11"/>Bɔr uwuruwi aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ awe ru uzĩ, azɛ̃rhã akɔn ru uzĩ. Asi ihwɛnga anangkɛ unga aka izĩ, ubinkutsu uzĩ uku utsu unga itapa.<verse eid="1JN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12"/>Umum itsɛnga umbi, aze awɛkaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:12">ubinkutsu aka atsũwãmbɔ arhimmbi ri itsinga.<verse eid="1JN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13"/>Umum itsɛnga umbi, atei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi unga uwu ha aka awe ri inggbaashia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Umum itsɛnga umbi, awɛdzɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">ubinkutsu umbi aka anangmbi uwuku ubewe ha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Umum itsɛnga umbi, aze awɛkaci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">ubinkutsu, umbi ahwɛngmbi Utɛ ha.<verse eid="1JN 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14"/>Umum itsɛnga umbi, atei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">ubinkutsu, umbi ahwɛngmbi unga uwu ha aka awe ri inggbaashia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">Umum itsɛnga umbi, awɛdzɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">ubinkutsu, umbi awu akerketambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">na Arherhu-Num asei ru umbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">nu umbi aka anangmbi uwuku ubewe ha.<verse eid="1JN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15"/>Àka niba abemumbi upfung use abinkɛ aka awe ru upfung. Ubɛn unera aka abemu upfung, ibibemu Utɛ ha ishingge ru unga. <verse eid="1JN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16"/>Ubɛn ubinkpi uku uwe ru upfung ru nyaki ikponi iyor, nu unyɛ̃ɛ̃ asu nu ifĩrhã abinkɛ umɛn iki iwu ra ake, ake asi idzeke ru Utɛ, bɔr adzeka ru upfung. <verse eid="1JN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17"/>Upfung nu abin ikponi iyorke awuri itɔng, bɔr uwuruwi aka akorha abinkɛ Unum aka abee, awuri ibɛka ugbagbaa.<verse eid="1JN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igbiir ato ra abika akpɛ̃ Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18"/>A aze angwɛ̃mum, ivang iyiki imimasha riyɛ. Ru nyaka umbi aka agũ agɛ, uwuku ukpɛ̃ Ukiristo uwɔ abarɔ, uko icɛrɛ arhɛrha abika akpɛ̃ Ukiristo aka abambɔ. Ngge itsu umɛn ihwɛng ivang imimasha iyɛrɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19"/>Umbɔ adzeku umɛn, bɔr asi iwembɔ abimɛn. Agɛ umbɔ awe abimɛn, umbɔ asei nggu umɛn, bɔr uzɛ̃rhãmbɔ udɛyiwe ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ ugɛ uko unying ru umbɔ asi iwea uwu umɛn.<verse eid="1JN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20"/>Bɔr umbɔ aka adzaambɔ umbi Ipfu Isarsatangge, nu kishoo umbi ahwɛngmbi idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="1JN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21"/>Umum itsɛnga umbi akɛrɛ, asi iwea ugɛ umbi asi ihwɛngmbi idzidzɛrhe, bɔr umbi ahwɛngmbi ngge, ikɛi umbi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ idzidzɛrhe isi isaki imarngge igbɛrangwĩ. <verse eid="1JN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22"/>Ungamɔ awu uner igbɛrangwĩ? Awu uner ha aka atsɛyi ugɛ Uyesu asi iwea Ukiristo. Ikpũ uner ha awu uwuku ukpɛ̃ Ukiristo, unga atsɛyinga Utɛ nu Ungwɛ̃. <verse eid="1JN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23"/>Unera ashia aka itsɛyi Ungwɛ̃, na awea ru Utɛ. Bɔr ubɛn unera aka ayɛisa Ungwɛ̃, aka ayɛi Utɛ nukpɔ.<verse eid="1JN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24"/>Àka atsu amɛnmbi ri imesayɛ umbi aka agũ ri inggbaashia iwe ru umbi. Iba iwengge, umbi awuri iseimbi ru Ungwɛ̃ nu Utɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25"/>Akɛrɛ ha ake awe ibibemuwe ha unga aka abemuwa umɛn uko urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa.<verse eid="1JN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26"/>Umum itsɛnga umbi akɛrɛ ra arherhe abirabɛ aka abee itsu umbi ayapa. <verse eid="1JN 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27"/>Bɔr umbi aka ayɛimbi Ipfu Isarsatangge, unga asei ru umbi, nu umbi asi ibeembi uner uwɔɔ amesuwa umbi. Bɔr Ipfu ha imesuwangge umbi ubɛn ubinkpi uku umɛ̃ɛ̃ umbi ahwɛng, nu abinkɛ unga aka amesuwa awu idzidzɛrhe, asi iweke igbɛrangwĩ. Ru nyaka unga aka amesuwa umbi, àka asei ri iwɛrhɛ ru Ukiristo.<verse eid="1JN 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angwɛ̃ Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28"/>Icɛrɛ umbi aze awɛkaci, àka asei ru Ukiristo, ngge itsú ivangyɛ unga aka idzeka, umɛn ima iwe ru ikeramɛn isi ígũmɛn atsa ra asunga.<verse eid="1JN 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29"/>Umbi aba ahwɛngmbi agɛ unga arhiku uner, umbi ahwɛngmbi agɛ ubɛn unera aka akorhi ifɛrhɛ iyiki irhirhika, awu Ukiristo amar uner ha.<verse eid="1JN 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1"/>Àka anyã nggaa ibibema iyɛ Utɛ aka abema umɛn, ngge itsu umbɔ ayisa umɛn angwɛ̃ Unum! Umɛn iwe rimi hã! Upfung usi ihwɛngkpɔ unga, ngge itsu ukpɔ usi ihwɛngkpɔ umɛn. <verse eid="1JN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2"/>A aze awɛrhɛ, icɛrɛ umɛn iwu angwɛ̃ Unum, anasi idɛyiwambɔ umɛn ubinkpi umɛn iki iwe. Bɔr umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ Ukiristo aba adzekanga, umɛn iwuri iwe ru nyaka unga, ubinkutsu, umɛn iwuri inyãmɛn unga aka awe. <verse eid="1JN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3"/>Ubɛn unera aka awe ru ifosa iyɛrɛ ru unga, aka isaka asare itsinga ru nyaka unga aka awe asasar.<verse eid="1JN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4"/>Ubɛn unera aka awe ra arhim azharhuwe ikpem, idzidzɛrhe arhim awu ida ikpem. <verse eid="1JN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5"/>Bɔr umbi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ unga adzeka, ngge ítsu unga ama asorhuwa arhimmɛn. Ikɛi ru unga arhim ashike. <verse eid="1JN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6"/>Unera ashia aka isei ru unga na anu ikorha arhim. Uner uwuku unu ikorha arhim anasi inyãã unga use ahwɛnga unga.<verse eid="1JN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7"/>A aze awɛkaci, àka niba aneke unera adarha umbi ayapumbi. Uwuruwi aki ikorhi iyiki irhika unga awu uner uwuku urhurhika, ru nyaka Ukiristo aka awu uner uwuku urhurhika. <verse eid="1JN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8"/>Unga uwuku unu ikorhe abin arhim unga awe uwu Undenggũ, ubinkutsu, Undenggũ awu ra arhim utsɛku ri inggbaashia. Ubin hã nukpɔ uku utsu Ungwɛ̃ Unum adzeka ru upfung, unga aba itsĩme itser Undenggũ.<verse eid="1JN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9"/>Unerwi Unum aka amar asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃nga itser arhim, ubinkutsu, ikpũ iyi Unum iwengge ru unga. Asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhumbɔ itser arhim, ubinkutsu Unum amar unga. <verse eid="1JN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10"/>Ubin hã uku itsu umɛn ihwɛng abikasong awe angwɛ̃ Unum nu abikasong awe angwɛ̃ Undenggũ. Ubɛn unera aka asi ikorhunga abinkɛ aka arhika asi iwea ungwɛ̃ Unum, nu ubɛn unera aka asi ibemunga ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ.<verse eid="1JN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibema adɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11"/>Isarhe ha iyɛ umbi aka agũ ri inggbaashia ugɛ, umɛn ibema adɔka. <verse eid="1JN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12"/>Niba awembi ru nyaka Ukayinu, aka awe uwu undenggũ na afɛruka ungwɛ̃mbɔ. Awu use utsu unga afɛre unga? Ubinkutsu, itsernga iwu iyiki ibewe bɔr iyi ungwɛ̃mbɔ iwe iyiki irhika. <verse eid="1JN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13"/>Niba agũmbi idzeu, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, upfung uba ukpɛ̃kpɔ umbi. <verse eid="1JN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ umɛn iki itɔng akpe izĩmɛn urhɛ, ubinkutsu, umɛn ibemumɛn angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn. Ubɛn unera aka asi ibemunga undɔka, awu ra akpe. <verse eid="1JN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15"/>Ubɛn unera aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ, unga awu uwuku ufɛr aner. Umbi ahwɛngmbi agɛ uner uwuku ufɛr aner ashia ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa ru unga.<verse eid="1JN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ibibema iki iwe, ubinkutsu Uyesu Ukiristo adzowe urhɛnga ri itsimɛn. Imɛ̃ngge umɛn indzowe urhɛmɛn ri itsi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn. <verse eid="1JN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17"/>Unera aba awea ra abin aki upfung na anyã ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ aka abee na asi igũa atorh unga, ibibemu Unum ikorhu uguse iwe ru unga? <verse eid="1JN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18"/>A aze awɛkaci, umɛn niba ibemumɛn nggu irhɛm arherhe ra angwĩ ukpekũ, bɔr umɛn ikũ itser nu idzidzɛrhe indɛyiwe. <verse eid="1JN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19"/>Akɛrɛ ha awuri itsu umɛn ihwɛng ugɛ umɛn iwemɛn ri idzidzɛrhe, umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ itsu amɛnmɛn awoshuke ra asunga, <verse eid="1JN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20"/>amɛnmɛn aba atsukake umɛn uvau. Unum ananga amɛnmɛn, na ahwɛnga abina kishoo.<verse eid="1JN 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21"/>Umbi awɛrhɛ, amɛnmɛn aba asi itsukake umɛn uvau, umɛn iwemɛn ri ikeramɛn ra asu Unum <verse eid="1JN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22"/>ni iyɛi ubɛn ubinkpi umɛn iki irhusa unga, ubinkutsu umɛn idɔsi ikpemnga ni ikorhu ubinkpi unga aka abema. <verse eid="1JN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23"/>Ikpemnga hã iyɛ, iwe ru imangmang ru Ungwɛ̃nga Uyesu Ukiristo, ni ibema adɔka ru nyaka unga aka atsu ri ikpem. <verse eid="1JN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24"/>Abika adɔsi ikpemnga asei ru unga, nu unga asei ru umbɔ. Umɛn ihwɛng ugɛ unga awe ru umɛn, ubinkutsu, Ipfunga ha unga aka adzaa umɛn.<verse eid="1JN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Aviri ípfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1"/>A aze awɛrhɛ, àka niba awembi ri imangmang ru ubɛn ipfu, bɔr àka aviri ípfu ha anyã use idzeku Unum. Ubinkutsu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num igbɛrangwĩ arhɛrhɛ aka adzeka ru upfunga. <verse eid="1JN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2"/>Umbi awuri ihwɛng Ipfu-Num riminɛ, ubɛn ipfuyɛ iki idzowukungge ideka igɛ Uyesu Ukiristo adzeka ri iyor, ipfu ha idzeku Unum, <verse eid="1JN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3"/>bɔr ubɛn ipfuyɛ iki isi idzowukungge ideka ru Uyesu, isi idzengge ru Unum. Iyɛrɛ ha iwu iyiki ikpɛ̃ Ukiristo, iyiriyɛ umbi aka agũ ngge iki iwuri iba, icɛrɛ iki iwengge ru upfung.<verse eid="1JN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4"/>Umbi, aze awɛkaci, umbi adzeku Unum, umbi aka anangmbi umbɔ, ubinkutsu uwu ha aka awe ru umbi ananga uwuku uwe ru upfung. <verse eid="1JN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5"/>Umbɔ awe abi upfung nggee umbɔ arherhe arherhe aka adzeku upfung, upfung ukpeto ru umbɔ. <verse eid="1JN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6"/>Umɛn indzeku Unum. Abirabɛ aka ahwɛng Unum, akpeto ru umɛn, bɔr abirabɛ aka asi idzembɔ ru Unum, asi ikpembɔ ato ru umɛn. Akɛrɛ ha atsu umɛn ihwɛng Ipfu iyi idzidzɛrhe nu ipfu iyi igbɛrangwĩ.<verse eid="1JN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibibemu Unum nu iyimɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7"/>A aze awɛrhɛ, awu ufang umɛn ĩbema adɔka, ubinkutsu, ibibema idzeku Unum. Ubɛn uwuku ububema, awu Unum amar unga nu unga ahwɛnga Unum. <verse eid="1JN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8"/>Ubɛn unera aka asi ibemunga asi ihwɛnga Unum, ubinkutsu, Unum awu ibibema. <verse eid="1JN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9"/>Udĩ hã ukpi Unum aka adɛyiwa ibibemanga ru umɛn, unga aka adene unanyĩ Ungwɛ̃nga aba ru upfung ugɛ umɛn ima ibɛk ru uboknga. <verse eid="1JN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10"/>Undzumu ibibema iyɛ, Unum abema umɛn utsɛku unga aka adene Ungwɛ̃nga awu idɛm-Num iyiki itsũwe arhimmɛn, asi iwea umɛn ibemu Unum.<verse eid="1JN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11"/>A aze awɛrhɛ, ngge iki iwe ugɛ Unum abema umɛn, imɛ̃ngge umɛn ibema adɔka. <verse eid="1JN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12"/>Unera anasi inyã Unum, bɔr umɛn ĩba ibemumɛn adɔka, Unum asei ru umɛn, ibibemanga ighwɛrngge ikpũrhã ru umɛn.<verse eid="1JN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ umɛn isei ru unga, nu unga asei ru umɛn, ubinkutsu, unga aka adzaanga umɛn Ipfunga. <verse eid="1JN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14"/>Umɛn inyãmɛn ni idekuwe ugɛ Utɛ unga adene Ungwɛ̃, unga awe uner Uwuku Ufɔrh upfunga. <verse eid="1JN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15"/>Unera aba adekuka ugɛ Uyesu awu Ungwɛ̃ Unum, Unum asei ru unga nu unga asei ru Unum. <verse eid="1JN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16"/>Nggee umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ni iwemɛn ri imangmang ru ibibemu Unum ru umɛn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Unum awu ibibema. Ubɛn unera aka asei ri ibibema asei ru Unum, nu Unum ru unga. <verse eid="1JN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17"/>Ru udĩ ukpirɛ, ibibema ighwɛrngge ikpũrhã ru umɛn. Ngge ítsu umɛn iwe ru ikeramɛn ru unum ukpuku uvarha arherhe, ubinkutsu, ru upfung ukpirɛ umɛn iwe ru nyaka unga. <verse eid="1JN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18"/>Nggee, iwei ishingge ri ibibema. Bɔr ibibema iki ighwɛr ikpũrhã iwayiwe iwei, ubinkutsu, iwei iwu nggu imesuwe amɛn. Unerwi aka awe ru iwei, ibibema isi ighwɛrngge ikpũrhã ru unga.<verse eid="1JN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19"/>Umɛn ibema, ubinkutsu, unga agbaashia abema umɛn. <verse eid="1JN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum inbemu Unum,&gt;&gt; na akpɛ̃ɛ̃ ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ, uner ha agbɛra angwĩ. Ubinkutsu, ubɛn unera aka asi ibemunga ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ unga aka anyã, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abemunga Unum, unga aka asi inyãã. <verse eid="1JN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21"/>Unga aka adzaanga umɛn ikpem iyɛrɛ, ubɛn unera aka ubemu Unum, awu ufang unga abemu ungwɛ̃mbɔ nu unapumbɔ.<verse eid="1JN 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Imangmang ru Ungwɛ̃ Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1"/>Ubɛn uwuku uwe ru imangmang agɛ Uyesu awu Ukiristo, awu Unum amar unga, nu ubɛn unerwi aka abemu Utɛ abema ungwɛ̃nga ikɛi. <verse eid="1JN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2"/>Ubin hã ukpi uku itsu umɛn ihwɛng ugɛ umɛn inbemumɛn angwɛ̃ Unum, ri ibemu Unum nu idɔsi ikpemnga. <verse eid="1JN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3"/>Idɔsi íkpem Unum ngge iwu ibibema ru Unum. Ikpemnga isi ighongge, <verse eid="1JN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4"/>ubɛn unerwi Unum aka amar aka ananga upfunga. Imangmangmɛn ngge itsu umɛn inang upfung hã. <verse eid="1JN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5"/>Ungamɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ anang upfunga? Awu uwuruwi aka awe ru imangmang agɛ Uyesu awu Ungwɛ̃ Unum.<verse eid="1JN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ideka ri itsi Ungwɛ̃ Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6"/>Uyesu Ukiristo adzeka ru nyaku Ungwɛ̃ Unum ri isorhu ubɔtisima ra amɛ̃ nu itare adzirhnga. Unga asi ibanga ra amɛ̃ ukpekũ, bɔr aba ra amɛ̃ nu adzirh. Awu Ipfu-Num ngge ideka, ubinkutsu, Ipfu-Num ha ngge iwu idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="1JN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7"/>Abina awu ataar aka adekuwe, <verse eid="1JN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8"/>awu Ipfu-Num, amɛ̃, nu adzirh ha, aki itatake arherhe ubina unying. <verse eid="1JN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9"/>Umɛn ibemumɛn ideka anera, bɔr ideku Unum inangge, ubinkutsu, ideka ha iwu iyi Unum iyiriyɛ unga aka adekuwe ri itsi Ungwɛ̃nga. <verse eid="1JN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10"/>Ubɛn unera aka awe ru imangmang ru Ungwɛ̃ Unum, awea ri ideka ha ra amɛnnga. Ubɛn unera aka ashia ri imangmang ru Unum, unga atsu Unum awe uner igbɛrangwĩ, ubinkutsu, unga asi iwea ri imangmang ri ideka ha Unum aka adekuwe ri itsi Ungwɛ̃nga. <verse eid="1JN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11"/>Urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa Unum aka adzaa umɛn umgbɔ uwu ideka ha, nu urhɛ ha udzeku Ungwɛ̃nga. <verse eid="1JN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12"/>Unga uwuku uwe ru Ungwɛ̃ hã awea ru urhɛ, bɔr uwuku usheru Ungwɛ̃ Unum, ashia ru urhɛ.<verse eid="1JN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imimasha itsɛng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13"/>Umum itsɛng abin akɛrɛ ru umbi abika awe ru imangmang ri itsok Ungwɛ̃ Unum, ngge ítsu umbi ama ahwɛng agɛ umbi awembi ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="1JN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14"/>Umɛn iwemɛn ri ikeramɛn iyiki izĩ ru Unum, ugɛ umɛn ĩba ifɛna unga ubɛn ubina ri ibibemanga, unga awuri igũa umɛn. <verse eid="1JN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15"/>Nu umɛn ĩba ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ unga agũã umɛn ri ivangyɛ umɛn iki ifɛna unga, umɛn ihwɛng ugɛ umɛn ikpomɛn ru ubin hã umɛn iki ifɛna ru unga.<verse eid="1JN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16"/>Ubɛn unera aba anyã ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ akorhunga arhimkɛ aka asi ikũna unga azĩke akpe, unga afɛne-Num. Unum awuri idzowuka unga urhɛ. Umum ĩgɔr abirabɛ arhimmbɔ aka asi ikũ umbɔ azĩke akpe. Arhim akɔɔ akũ azĩke akpe. Umum isi irherhumum ugɛ unga afɛne-Num ru ikpũ aki ha. <verse eid="1JN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17"/>Kishoo ida irhirhika awu arhim, bɔr arhim akɔɔ asi íkũ unera atsĩke ra akpe.<verse eid="1JN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ ubɛn unerwi Unum aka amar, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃nga itser arhim. Uyesu uwu Unum aka amar, adzɛu uner ha, uwuku ubewe ha asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhunga ubin ru unga.<verse eid="1JN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ umɛn iwe angwɛ̃ Unum, nu upfunga kishoo uwu ru ubok uwuku ubewe ha.<verse eid="1JN 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20"/>Umɛn ikɛi ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ Ungwɛ̃ Unum aka aba adzaanga umɛn ihwihwɛng, ngge ítsu umɛn ihwɛng unga aka awe idzidzɛrhe. Nu umɛn iwe ru unga aka awe idzidzɛrhe, ru Ungwɛ̃nga Uyesu Ukiristo. Unga awe Unum uwu idzidzɛrhe nu urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa.<verse eid="1JN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21"/>A aze awɛkaci, àka aneke idɔsa agberhe.<verse eid="1JN 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5"/>
</usx>
